@anon.53fe85e3a453dfbf0ab1e8743506e67c.1168 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [615 x i8] }> <{ [615 x i8] c"A bullet list.\0A\0ADisplays a sequence of items vertically, with each item introduced by a\0Amarker.\0A\0A# Example\0A```example\0ANormal list.\0A- Text\0A- Math\0A- Layout\0A- ...\0A\0AMultiple lines.\0A- This list item spans multiple\0A  lines because it is indented.\0A\0AFunction call.\0A#list(\0A  [Foundations],\0A  [Calculate],\0A  [Construct],\0A  [Data Loading],\0A)\0A```\0A\0A# Syntax\0AThis functions also has dedicated syntax: Start a line with a hyphen,\0Afollowed by a space to create a list item. A list item can contain multiple\0Aparagraphs and other block-level content. All content that is indented\0Amore than an item's marker becomes part of that item." }>, align 1
